<title>USA: Trimark Holdings to buy back shrs.</title>
<headline>Trimark Holdings to buy back shrs.</headline>
<dateline>LOS ANGELES 1997-02-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trimark Holdings Inc said on Friday that its board of directors has authorized management to spend up to $1.5 million, $750,000 per fiscal year, to purchase shares of Trimark common stock in the open market or through privately negotiated transactions.</p>
<p>The company said that any shares so purchased are intended to be used for general corporate purposes.</p>
<p>Trimark has about 4.24 million shares outstanding.</p>
<p>Trimark stock closed at 3-5/8 Thursday.</p>
</text>
